cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, its harness, or its data, please cite it."
title: AgentRuleBench
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark testing whether AI coding agents violate architectural
  import-boundary rules inferred from real codebases. On the rule tested, across
  three vendors' models and every condition including an unguarded control, it
  reports a null: the agents did not violate the boundary.
authors:
